    <statement><p>Match each vector field with its graph.</p>
<p><ol>
<li>
<p><m>\vec{H}(x,y) = x\vec{i} - y\vec{j}</m></p>
</li>
<li>
<p><m>\displaystyle \vec{G}(x,y) = -y\vec{i} + x\vec{j}</m></p>
</li>
<li>
<p><m>\displaystyle \vec{F}(x,y) = x\vec{i} + y\vec{j}</m></p>
</li>
</ol></p>
